# Build-context hygiene.
#
# CI restores a pinned Go toolchain into .toolchain/ and the module/build caches
# into .cache/, both INSIDE the project directory, because the runner is a shell
# executor with nowhere else that is writable and cached. Without this file every
# image build would ship all of that to the Docker daemon before doing any work.
#
# .git is excluded too: the image build does not need it, because the version is
# computed in CI and passed in as --build-arg VERSION.

.git/
.gitattributes
.gitignore
.gitlab-ci.yml
.toolchain/
.cache/
bin/
dist/
data/
docs/
ci/
*.sng
*.exe
*.test
